@BASE_URL = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4

### Lista Estudantes
GET {{BASE_URL}}/export-srv/Estudantes

### Filtra Estudante por email
GET {{BASE_URL}}/export-srv/Estudantes(email='joao.silva@example.com')

### Cria Estudante
POST {{BASE_URL}}/export-srv/Estudantes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "João",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
  "created_at": "2024-06-05"
}